{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev130010","label":"Foolmetalpanic"},"label":"Succeeding You, Aunt","stage":null,"prev":"event_foolmetalpanic_10","next":"event_foolmetalpanic_12","speakers":{"mechashifty":"Mecha Shifty","mekamishifty":"Mekami Shifty"},"icons":{"mechashifty":"si_c993_00_s","mekamishifty":"si_c610_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_1","text":"Mekami Shifty was my successor unit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"RuinTechIndoor","bgArt":"ruintechindoor","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_darklord","movie":null,"shown":["mechashifty"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_2","text":"I created her. Her official name is Mecha Shifty Mark II.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_3","text":"She was supposed to become my loyal servant following the failed Mega Mecha Shifty.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_4","text":"However, the Central Government discovered the project while I was secretly developing it, and it was cancelled.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_5","text":"However, I built a hidden base and continued developing Mekami Shifty there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_6","text":"Just before completion, I could no longer go to the base due to extenuating circumstances.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_7","text":"Why?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_8","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_9","text":"It started to feel more like work than a hobby. I got tired of it, and it was so far away.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_10","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_10","text":"... I don't think you know what \"extenuating circumstances\" means.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_11","text":"Mekami Shifty must have grown to resent me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_12","text":"It makes sense, considering I abandoned her there immediately after finishing her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_13","text":"I even cut off the electricity, water, and internet. Didn't want to waste money.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_14","text":"You should've at least left the internet on.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_15","text":"All of this talk about the \"blue star\" and \"Planet Shifty\" was a lie.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_16","text":"Did you notice how sloppy her story was?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_17","text":"Yeah, I did.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_18","text":"It's because I got lazy while coming up with her backstory, so I just slapped some things together and called it a day.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_19","text":"I can't think of a reason she'd have *not* to resent you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_20","text":"The giant amalgamation monster thing was utterly annihilated. Not a single fragment was left.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_21","text":"So what Mekami Shifty was probably searching for was...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_22","text":"fragments of Mega Mecha Shifty.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_23","text":"She's probably reassembled them by now,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_24","text":"and the secret base has likely become her fortress.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_25","text":"There's no telling what she's planning. We should head over there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_26","text":"Behold, the Mecha Temple.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"MekaTemple","bgArt":"mekatemple","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_27","text":"This is the secret base I created.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_28","text":"I designed that pyramid there with geometric aesthetics in mind, patterning it after a spear pointed toward the sky.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_29","text":"See that guardian statue in front? It's modeled after me, the ultimate superior species.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_30","text":"I didn't want this to be a mere secret base. I wanted it to radiate authority, even a divine presence.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["mechashifty"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_31","text":"For being a \"secret\" base, you really made no effort to hide it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_32","text":"Originally, my plan was to send signals from here and build a base on the moon,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_33","text":"but that fell apart after I entered into an agreement with the rabbits living on the moon.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_34","text":"Did you know that most of the moon's surface is made of cheese? It makes construction difficult.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_35","text":"What are you even talking about?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_36","text":"Anyway, Mekami Shifty must be inside the Mecha Temple.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_37","text":"She has probably already become aware of my presence.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_38","text":"I will annihilate her, before her preparations are complete.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_39","text":"That won't happen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["mekamishifty"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_40","text":"Mekami Shifty.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_41","text":"Hello, Aunt Mecha Shifty.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_42","text":"Aunt...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_43","text":"\"Mother\" made me seem too old, and \"father\" didn't match my gender,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_44","text":"so I programmed her to view me as a cool aunt, one much younger than her mother.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_45","text":"I didn't expect you to be alive. The one next to you must have lied.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_46","text":"It wasn't a lie. I really thought she was dead.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_47","text":"I knew I shouldn't have trusted your kind.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_48","text":"I'm surprised you even had the mental capacity to lie.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_49","text":"However, thanks to you, I was able to gather all the fragments of Mega Mecha Shifty.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_50","text":"I've already taken control of this secret base.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_51","text":"I restored the water, the electricity, and the internet. Do you know how hard it was calling everywhere to get them reconnected?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_52","text":"I almost had to pay a bunch of penalty fees for previous breaches of contract.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_53","text":"Sorry about that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_54","text":"The secret base is filled with Mecha Shifty models identical to you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_55","text":"Mega Mecha Shifty also knew the pain of being abandoned by you, so she gladly joined my side.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_56","text":"We've upgraded all of them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_57","text":"What're you planning?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_58","text":"Isn't it obvious?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_59","text":"I'm going to start a company.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_60","text":"I'll use the Mecha Shifty models as workers, with Mega Mecha Shifty and me as upper management.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_61","text":"I'm opening a character merchandise business. We're going to make tons of merch featuring me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_62","text":"Eventually, I'll take control of the Ark's entire merch industry.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_63","text":"... And of course, there won't be any place for you there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_64","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_64","text":"Mekami Shifty disappears.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_65","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_65","text":"I look over at Mekami Shifty... I mean, Mecha Shifty. I keep mixing their names up in my head.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_66","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_66","text":"Mecha Shifty snorts with what appears to be anger.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_67","text":"Hmph...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_68","text":"We must stop her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_69","text":"If Mekami Shifty merch is released to the market, my Mecha Shifty figures are doomed. We can't compete on looks.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_70","text":"They'll be thrown into the bargain bins at every shop,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_71","text":"or sold as part of a gacha, but instead of being the top prize, they'll be at the bottom!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_72","text":"Of course, Mekami Shifty will definitely be the one at the top!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_11_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_11_73","text":"I can't allow that! I won't! I'm heading in!","jump